notes: "This is the collaboration page. Codex and Claude Code use the local plugin; ChatGPT reaches the local editor through the authorized workstation route; DeepSeek Harness mounts the bundle. They share one writer, so different pages can be saved independently, but two edits to the same page conflict even if they touch different objects. Project Story, Sections and order share a metadata revision. Activity shows declared stages and saved receipts, not live presence or an automatic section lock. A content-to-design handoff works through saved operations and revisions: read the saved state, then preview, apply and render the focused change."
